        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/5840529005b4e8656782a8116e54d65c.poster.avif?t=1765572853\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/5840529005b4e8656782a8116e54d65c.webm?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/5840529005b4e8656782a8116e54d65c.mp4?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A mainly competitive game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/018f4c1906af0d2b224f0710ee5469e7.poster.avif?t=1765572853\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/018f4c1906af0d2b224f0710ee5469e7.webm?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/018f4c1906af0d2b224f0710ee5469e7.mp4?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the way, there's a penalty for hitting the other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main objective is to survive long enough to finish the arenas, so you might choose to cooperate, but remember: you also want to score  better (win more!) than your friends! Don't tell anyone I said that, but I heard there're tons of strategies like throwing yourself in front of their shot, so they can get a penalty or killing them on purpose so they can't score anymore. Who would do such things? Not you, right?!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cool Spacial Arenas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/cbc5da320b079848d675c095369534e1.poster.avif?t=1765572853\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/cbc5da320b079848d675c095369534e1.webm?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/cbc5da320b079848d675c095369534e1.mp4?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cool special arenas with crazy effects that will most likely make you rethink your strategy! Those include: Slowdown (supernova), Teleport (wormhole) and Meteorites with more to come.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crazy different enemy patterns</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/f02cd04c4388d8afde08f258170b9cce.poster.avif?t=1765572853\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/f02cd04c4388d8afde08f258170b9cce.webm?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/f02cd04c4388d8afde08f258170b9cce.mp4?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you tired of seeing the same bullet patterns over and over again?!  <br>No? <br>...<br>But do you want to to see some different cool ones we made? They are cool, I swear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/7408041824d82553357d51ce2f39333c.poster.avif?t=1765572853\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/7408041824d82553357d51ce2f39333c.webm?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/7408041824d82553357d51ce2f39333c.mp4?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With our newest technology innovation you can build your own spawn rules. Just don't break the game, ok? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Match modifiers </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/f41f67a6b2a883a4d0b2047317c40f29.poster.avif?t=1765572853\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/f41f67a6b2a883a4d0b2047317c40f29.webm?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/f41f67a6b2a883a4d0b2047317c40f29.mp4?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to customize the match to your liking? Be prepared for a huge list of modifiers that can completely change how the game is played. I heard cool combinations are still being found up to this date, so don't be shy to share it with everyone in the public forums!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/7ae90466002387e60134d1c14a9a0d8f.poster.avif?t=1765572853\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/7ae90466002387e60134d1c14a9a0d8f.webm?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/7ae90466002387e60134d1c14a9a0d8f.mp4?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>B<strong>ut what if I'm too lazy to select the modifiers mister omniscient narrator</strong>?</i> Don't worry! We get you covered with the <strong>RANDOM CHAOS</strong> modifier that activates modifiers randomly during the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/d7a48305f4281b5ead93d28f81383203.poster.avif?t=1765572853\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/d7a48305f4281b5ead93d28f81383203.webm?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/d7a48305f4281b5ead93d28f81383203.mp4?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> The usage of random chaos may incur in fatal interactions for which I'm not responsible for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use modifiers to customize the win condition for the match:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/505893d252a9775bbdb15c9ae348ce02.avif?t=1765572853\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 Game modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival - This is the standard game mode where when you die, you're dead! The match ends if you survive long enough or everyone dies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade - Very similar to survival, but you actually get back from the dead after 3s, loosing some points in the revival process. I heard this dynamic makes killing your friends in the last second worth it, but who knows? Strange rumors, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training mode - Perfect to actually understand the mechanics and how the enemies work without all the chaos. In this mode the host controls the enemies spawn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn Rule Builder mode - In this mode everyone takes turns putting spawns in the arena until everyone is dead.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to this Hell of A bullet Hell!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/88f2f5cff39681614925fe593d5137cb.poster.avif?t=1765572853\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/88f2f5cff39681614925fe593d5137cb.webm?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017480/extras/88f2f5cff39681614925fe593d5137cb.mp4?t=1765572853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access version of the game includes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different arenas with 3 different mechanics (teleportation, slowdown and meteor madness).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different enemies with unique patterns and behaviors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards (standard mode only).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer (up to 4 people).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor to create your own spawn rules and a spawn rule builder Game mode that allow you to change the arena mid match with your friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop to download spawn rules created by other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win condition modifiers so you can personalize the play as much as you want. Want to go full competitive? Try activating the &quot;Last Player standing&quot; modifier!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Match modifiers that can make your match very different. Who put a physics based ship in this?!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RANDOM CHAOS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 game modes: Standard survival, Training (host controls spawn), Spawn Rule builder and Arcade.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
