s).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different enemies with unique patterns and behaviors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards (standard mode only).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer (up to 4 people).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor to create your own spawn rules and a spawn rule builder Game mode that allow you to change the arena mid match with your friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop to download spawn rules created by other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win condition modifiers so you can personalize the play as much as you want. Want to go full competitive? Try activating the &quot;Last Player standing&quot; modifier!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Match modifiers that can make your match very different. Who put a physics based ship in this?!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RANDOM CHAOS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 game modes: Standard survival, Training (host controls spawn), Spawn Rule builder and Arcade.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
